Source attribution. Every task is derived from an open-access article published under a
CC BY license. papers.jsonl lists each article's PMCID and DOI; maps cite the passages they
draw on. When you use a task, credit its source article as well as HypoMap-Bench.

Model outputs. The answers in outputs/ and the judge and reward calls in results/ were
generated by third-party models (GPT-6 Luna, Gemini 3.8 Flash, Qwen3-8B, Fisher-R1-14B,
BioMistral-7B and models fine-tuned from Qwen3-8B). They are released under CC BY 4.0 for
research reproducibility, to the extent we hold rights in them; their use is also subject to
the terms of the providers and licenses of those models.
